33
00:02:41,435 --> 00:02:47,319
This was a turning point in my life.

34
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:50,457
And I completed my study of physics formally as quickly as I could.

35
00:02:50,457 --> 00:02:58,599
One moral of the above story is of course, that we must be very careful

36
00:02:58,599 --> 00:02:59,374
when we give advice to younger people.

37
00:02:59,374 --> 00:03:00,356
Sometimes they follow it.

38
