170
00:13:38,638 --> 00:13:42,536
It was then that I had the blackest week in the whole of my professional life.

171
00:13:42,536 --> 00:13:48,137
Perhaps the most saddening thing now is that even after all those years

172
00:13:48,137 --> 00:13:55,118
of frustrating experience, still so many people honestly believe

173
