They silence their doubts by observe, and how many of these machines have been sold

175
00:14:05,177 --> 00:14:15,560
and derive from that observation, the false sense of security that after all

176
00:14:15,560 --> 00:14:15,873
the design cannot have been that bad.

177
00:14:17,733 --> 00:14:22,518
But upon closer inspection, that line of defense has the same convincing

178
00:14:22,518 --> 00:14:27,096
strength as the argument that cigarette smoking must be healthy

179
00:14:27,096 --> 00:14:30,459
because so many people do it.

180
00:14:30,459 --> 00:14:33,919
It is in this connection.

181
00:14:33,919 --> 00:14:38,600
That I regret that it's not customer for scientific journals in the

182
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:43,460
computing area to publish reviews of newly announced computers.

183
00:14:43,460 --> 00:14:47,456
In much the same way as we review scientific publications to review

184
00:14:47,456 --> 00:14:48,913
machines would be at least as important.

185
00:14:48,913 --> 00:14:54,019
And here I have a confession to make.

186
00:14:54,019 --> 00:15:00,137
In the early sixties, I wrote such a review where the intention of submitting

187
00:15:00,137 --> 00:15:02,900
it to the communications of the AC.

188
00:15:02,900 --> 00:15:08,308
But in spite of the fact that the few colleagues to whom the text was

189
00:15:08,308 --> 00:15:14,799
sent for their advice urged me all to do so, I didn't dare to submit it

190
00:15:14,799 --> 00:15:17,157
fearing that the difficulties either for myself or for the editorial

191
00:15:17,173 --> 00:15:19,916
bolt would prove to be too great.

192
00:15:19,916 --> 00:15:29,000
This suppression was an act of cowardice on my side, for

193
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:29,200
which I blame myself more and.

194
00:15:30,813 --> 00:15:35,097
The difficulties I foresaw were a consequence of the absence of a generally

195
00:15:35,097 --> 00:15:42,259
accepted criteria, and although I was convinced of the validity of the criteria

196
00:15:42,259 --> 00:15:48,459
I had chosen to apply, I feared that my review will be refused to discard

197
00:15:48,459 --> 00:15:49,574
it as a matter of personal taste.

198
00:15:50,733 --> 00:15:56,058
I still think that such reviews would be extremely useful

199
00:15:56,058 --> 00:15:59,239
and I'm longing to see them.

200
00:15:59,239 --> 00:16:05,060
For their accepted appearance would be a sure sign of maturity

