00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:19,020
because I have the feeling that one of the most important aspects of any

204
00:16:19,020 --> 00:16:22,615
computing tool is its influence on the thinking habits of those that try to use.

205
00:16:23,633 --> 00:16:30,240
And because I have reasons to believe that that influence is many times

206
00:16:30,240 --> 00:16:30,440
stronger than is commonly assumed.

207
00:16:32,193 --> 00:16:38,420
Let me now switch our attention to the software scene.

208
00:16:38,420 --> 00:16:43,260
Here, the diversity has been so large that I must confine

