of their TIC unit implies a large overhead on the subroutine mechanism.

225
00:18:01,594 --> 00:18:07,602
But even that didn't kill the concept of the subroutine, and we can only pray that

226
00:18:07,602 --> 00:18:07,813
the mutation won't prove to be hereditary.

227
00:18:11,173 --> 00:18:14,717
The second major development on the software scene that I would like

228
00:18:14,717 --> 00:18:16,412
to mention is the birth of Fortran.

